### The LYSO panel's own radioactivity alone (no cosmic rays): one Lu-176 decay per event at a random point of the panel
### (/GeneralParticleSource 3), every event with energy in the panel written (/EventFilter 7). Its live time is events /
### activity (printed at the end of the run and kept in the run tree). The geometry of macro/muonic_xray_lyso.mac.
###   ./TOFmeter --preinit macro/preinit_lyso.mac macro/lyso_decay_only.mac
### Needs the aliases czSeed, czEvents, czDir, czFile, tgtCm, tgtZ and cztZ as macro/muonic_xray_lyso.mac, and
### tgtMat (the target material, e.g. G4_Al: the target scatters the panel's gammas back into it).

/tof/det/worldSize 420 420 300 cm
/tof/det/stack false
/tof/target/size 20 20 {tgtCm} cm
/tof/target/position 0 0 {tgtZ} cm
/tof/target/material {tgtMat}
/control/execute macro/panel_lyso.mac
/tof/czt/position 0 0 {cztZ} cm
/update
/process/had/rdm/nucleusLimits 176 176 71 72

/OutputFormat 1
/EventFilter 7
/OutputDirectory {czDir}
/OutputFile {czFile}
/gun/seed {czSeed}
/GeneralParticleSource 3
# as macro/muonic_xray_lyso.mac: Auger electrons off, fluorescence on
/process/em/auger false
/process/em/augerCascade false
/run/beamOn {czEvents}
